适用范围说明 / Scope

本授权覆盖本仓库中的全部原创内容，包括源代码（src/、tools/）、
美术与音频简报（briefs/）、文档，以及由这些代码渲染出的成片、封面与静帧。

第三方组件不在此授权范围内，各自遵循原有许可：
p5.js（LGPL-2.1）、p5.brush（MIT）、puppeteer-core（Apache-2.0）、
ffmpeg（LGPL/GPL，仅外部调用、不随仓库分发）。详见 NOTICE.md 与
THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md。

This license covers all original content in this repository: the source code
(src/, tools/), the art and audio briefs (briefs/), the documentation, and the
rendered film, cover and stills produced by that code.

Third-party components are not relicensed here and keep their original terms:
p5.js (LGPL-2.1), p5.brush (MIT), puppeteer-core (Apache-2.0), ffmpeg
(LGPL/GPL, invoked externally and never bundled). See NOTICE.md and
THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md.
